# Apple Design (HIG) — Paidia

When reviewing or changing UI/UX, follow the installed skill:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/apple-design/SKILL.md`
2. Route topics via `.cursor/skills/apple-design/references/hig-lookup.md`
3. Load only the relevant `references/hig/*.md` files (typically 3–8)
4. Cite guideline sections; use **vanilla JS / CSS / PWA** terms (not SwiftUI)

## Paidia constraints (do not violate)

- Brand authority remains `design/VISUAL_MOTION_SYSTEM.md` + Armonia pine / Fraunces / Outfit — **not** a generic iOS clone
- Translate HIG “SF Pro / system blue” → our tokens (`--brand`, `--font-ui`, `--font-display`)
- Glass already ships (v106–v110): follow `liquid-glass.md` **restraint** — no extra purple glow, no glass on every card
- Mobile-first care-ops: tap ≥44, safe-area insets, bilingual DE/EL, Easy vs Pro density
- Prefer small diffs; no full redesign unless the user asks

## Where HIG applies hardest in this app

| Surface | HIG topics |
|---------|------------|
| Gate / PIN / Face ID | launching, privacy, accessibility, modality |
| Dock + desktop sidebar | layout, gestures, focus-and-selection |
| Sheets / tips / tour | modality, onboarding, offering-help |
| Liste / Lager / Plan | layout, feedback, entering-data, undo |
| Kids / school | typography, accessibility, inclusion |
| Child portal / games | motion, feedback, game-controls (light) |
| Zo-Ai chat | generative-ai, offering-help, privacy |
| Toasts / loading | feedback, loading |

